WEBVTT

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:31.323
that race is not how we define being an American.

00:14:31.323 --> 00:14:34.900
They expanded what it means to be an American,

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.224
including Japanese-Americans

00:14:37.224 --> 00:14:41.398
that were feared and suspected and hated.

00:14:41.398 --> 00:14:44.609
They were change agents,

00:14:44.609 --> 00:14:47.091
and they left for me

00:14:47.091 --> 00:14:49.308
a legacy.

00:14:49.308 --> 00:14:51.097
They are my heroes

00:14:51.097 --> 00:14:53.448
and my father is my hero,

00:14:53.448 --> 00:14:55.258
who understood democracy

00:14:55.258 --> 00:14:59.329
and guided me through it.

00:14:59.329 --> 00:15:01.819
They gave me a legacy,